      "multimodalEnabled": false
    },
    "long_instructions": "#Talk to a Game Engineer\r\n\r\nInterview Rylee, a Game Engineer with 6 years of experience. Rylee uses AI tools every day to write game code and they've seen what AI gets right and what it gets wrong. \r\n\r\n**Your job:** Ask Rylee at least 3 questions. At least one must be about how Rylee works with AI. \r\n\r\nIn your Unit Guide, capture:\r\n- Two specific things you learned\r\n- One thing that surprised you\r\n\r\nRefer to your Unit Guide for question ideas to get your started if you don't know what to ask. \r\n\r\n_Heads up: Rylee is an AI playing the role of a Game Engineer. Notice what feels like real working knowledge and what might be made up_"
  },
